# P43(WSL):由 actions/win/P43-gradient-clipped-to-the-shape.actions 移植，只需等待;以下註解為 Windows 檔原文,WSL 結果記在 results.csv2。
# P43 on Windows: a gradient clipped to the shape.
# Nothing is pressed: the app reads itself out. Run on 2026-10-19 with Swift 6.4.0, display at 125%, both Windows backends (TEST_BACKEND=WinUI and TEST_BACKEND=gtk4); rc=0 and the replay line on all.
# Pass: round gradient circle, flat control, gradient rectangle, a whole gradient ring.
# GTK: pass. WinUI: FAILS on the ring -- the gradient stroke is cut flat on all four sides
# by the frame, where SwiftUI and GTK draw the half of the stroke that lies outside it (open).
# FIXED later the same day (Swift 6.4.1): renderPath grows the Path by the stroke width on every side with a matching negative margin, so XAML no longer lays a layout clip on it. The whole ring is drawn; the other three shapes are unchanged. 同日稍後修正：圓環完整畫出。
